meta {
  name: Week 2 ready or degraded (needs W2_ENABLED)
  type: http
  seq: 23
}

get {
  url: {{agent}}/ready
  body: none
  auth: none
}

assert {
  res.status: eq 200
  res.body.status: in [ready, degraded]
  res.body.w2_checks.document_store.ok: eq true
}

docs {
  With W2_ENABLED the body adds w2_checks (document_store, vector_index, reranker). A Week 2 problem alone, such as a
  missing OPENROUTER_API_KEY, makes the status degraded but keeps the 200, because Week 1 and the Week 2 fallbacks still
  work. A Week 1 dependency failure is not_ready (503). These checks never call a model provider.
}
